msgstr "Enter your order number and phone on the <a href=\"%(track_url)s\">Track your order</a> page. The courier will call when on the way."

#: templates/pages/faq.html
#, python-format
msgid "Savatcha sahifasida «Promokod» maydoniga. Masalan, <b>OCLOCK10</b> — 10%% chegirma, <b>SOVGA15</b> — %(sum)sdan yuqori xaridga 15%%."
msgstr "In the “Promo code” field on the cart page. For example, <b>OCLOCK10</b> — 10%% off, <b>SOVGA15</b> — 15%% off orders over %(sum)s."

#: templates/pages/faq.html
#, python-format
msgid "Bu soat erkak va ayolga birdek mos keladi: neytral dizayn, o‘rtacha (odatda 35–42 mm) korpus, ortiqcha bezaksiz siferblat. Juftlik soati yoki sovg‘a uchun eng xavfsiz tanlov. <a href=\"%(unique_url)s\">Unique kolleksiyasi</a>"
msgstr "This watch suits men and women alike: neutral design, a medium case (usually 35–42 mm), a dial without extra decoration. The safest choice for matching watches or a gift. <a href=\"%(unique_url)s\">Unique collection</a>"

#: templates/pages/faq.html
msgid "<b>Kvarts</b> — batareyada, eng aniq va arzon. <b>Mexanik</b> — har kuni qo‘lda buraladi. <b>Avtomatik</b> — qo‘l harakatidan o‘zi buraladi, batareya kerak emas. <b>Smart</b> — telefon bilan bog‘lanadi, zaryadlanadi."
msgstr "<b>Quartz</b> — battery powered, the most accurate and affordable. <b>Mechanical</b> — wound by hand every day. <b>Automatic</b> — wind themselves from your wrist’s movement, no battery needed. <b>Smart</b> — connect to your phone and need charging."

#: templates/pages/faq.html
#, python-format
msgid "Asosiysi — kenglik. U soat sahifasida «Tasma kengligi» qatorida yozilgan (masalan, 20 mm). <a href=\"%(straps_url)s\">Tasmalar</a> bo‘limida «Kengligi» filtrida shu raqamni tanlang. Apple Watch uchun «Ulanishi» filtrida korpus o‘lchamini tanlang."
msgstr "The key is width. It’s listed on the watch page under “Strap width” (e.g. 20 mm). In the <a href=\"%(straps_url)s\">Straps</a> section, pick that number in the “Width” filter. For Apple Watch, choose your case size in the “Fitting” filter."

#: templates/pages/faq.html
#, python-format
